        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "On his wedding night, Caleb Wingate is ordered to kill his father-in-law before midnight or his bride dies. As a deadly assassin closes in and family secrets erupt, Caleb must uncover the truth before the night ends in blood.",
          "runtime": 87,
          "tagline": "The wedding was just the beginning.",
